# Build-context exclusions. The context root is `src/` (compose sets `build: ./src`),
# so `COPY app/` would otherwise carry host bytecode into an image that judges
# rebuild and inspect. Kept minimal on purpose: nothing here may hide a file the
# app needs at runtime.
#
# Patterns are matched relative to the context root, NOT like .gitignore: a bare
# `__pycache__/` was measured to leave `app/__pycache__/` in the image, hence the
# explicit `**/` prefixes. Verified by building `COPY app/` into a probe image.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
